WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Inside the stadium, follow the numbers.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.500
Narrator: Each vomitory has a sign with its block numbers.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:12.600
Narrator: In many stadiums the first digit tells you the level - but always check your venue.

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.500
Narrator: Rows are letters or numbers, usually starting near the pitch.

5
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.300
Narrator: And seat numbers run along each row.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.600
Narrator: So the route is always the same: gate, concourse, the vomitory with the right block sign, then the row, then the seat.

